<http://data.silknow.org/object/26862a50-74ec-3cbc-9f2a-4464954b326b/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Furnishing fabric of twilled silk satin. The silk is woven with a large scale florid pattern in brown, yellow and white on a red satin ground. An ogee-shaped compartment is formed by diapered scrolls and foliage, and intersected by heavy garlands of fruit and flowers. Above and below the main compartment is a smaller compartment formed by fruit, foliage and a celery-like plant at the corners."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/26862a50-74ec-3cbc-9f2a-4464954b326b> .

